        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምክንያት ። አንድም ፡ ዕብራዊ ፡ በበጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጠው ፡ እንዶድ ፡ ግብፃዊ ፡ ልጠብበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሏል ፡ እሱ ፡ በበጠበጠው ፡ እንዶድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተው ፡ እንጅ ፡ ይጠብበት ፡ ብሎታል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሁን ፡ ገላውን ፡ እንደ ፡ ቈርበት ፡ ሥጋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውን ፡ እንደ ፡ እንዶድ ፡ ደሙን ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውኃ ፡ አድርጌ ፡ ባጥብበት ፡ ታድነዋለህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎታል ፡ ወነጸረ ፡ ሙሴ ፡ ለፌ ፡ ወለፌ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላል ፡ ወዲያ ፡ ወዲህ ፡ አይቶ ፡ ክቡድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መዝራዕት፡ ነውና፡ በጥፊ፡ ቢለው፡ ባንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጊዜ ፡ ካሸዋ ፡ ቀላቅሎታል ፡ ምሳሌ ፡ ነው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሙሴ ፡ የጌታ ፡ ዕብራዊ ፡ የአዳም ፡ ግብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፃዊ ፡ የዲያብሎስ ፡ ጭዋ ፡ የሦስቱ ፡ አር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true,
          "stage1_text": "ፃዊ ፡ የዲያብሎስ ፡ ጭፃ ፡ የሦስቱ ፡ አር",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ጭፃ -> ጭዋ",
            "reason": "The printed glyph is ዋ (ጭዋ, sand/earth in the allegory of Moses burying the Egyptian in the sand), which was misread as ፃ."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እስተ ፡ ኃጣውእ ። አንድም ፡ የመስቀል።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፳፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፭ ፤ ወመሰሎ ፡ ዘየአምሩ ፡ አኃዊሁ ፡ ከመ ፡ በእዴ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁ ፡ ይሁቦሙ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ መድኀኒተ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንድሞቹ ፡ እስራኤል ፡ በሱ ፡ እጅ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዲያድናቸው ፡ የሚያውቁ ፡ መስሎት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእሙንቱሰ ፡ ኢለበዉ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እነሱ ፡ ግን ፡ አላወቁም ። አንድም ፡ አኃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዊሁ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ ናቸው ፡ በጌታ ፡ እጅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲያድናቸው ፡ አለማወቃቸውን ፡ ማወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቁን ፡ መናገር ፡ ነው ፡ እነሱም ፡ አላወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቁም ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፳፮",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፮ ፤ ወበሳኒታ ፡ ረከበ ፡ ክልኤተ፡ እምውስቴቶሙ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዘ ፡ ይትበአሱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በነጋው ፡ ሁለት ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ተጣልተው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አገኘ ፡ ዕብራዊና ፡ ዕብራዊ ፡ ናቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወፈቀደ ፡ ይዕርቆሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊያስታርቃቸው ፡ ወዶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይቤሎሙ ፡ ናሁ ፡ አንትሙሰ ፡ አኃው ፡ አንትሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እናንተማ ፡ ወንድማማቾች ፡ አይደላች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁምን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ለምንት ፡ ትትዔመፁ ፡ በበይናቲክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እርስ ፡ በርሳችሁ ፡ ለምን ፡ ትጣላላችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": "፳፯",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፯ ፤ ወይቤሎ ፡ ዝኩ ፡ ዘይዔምፆ ፡ ለካልኡ ፡ መኑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሤመከ ፡ መልአከ ፡ ወመኰንነ ፡ ላዕሌነ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጠብ ፡ አንሽው ፡ በኛ ፡ ላይ ፡ ዳኛ ፡ ፈራጅ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አድርጎ ፡ ማን ፡ ሹሞሃል ፡ አለው ፡ ጌታን፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በመባሕተ ፡ መኑ ፡ ትገብር ፡ ዘንተ ፡ ማለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታቸውን ፡ መናገር ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": "፳፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፰ ፤ ወሚመ ፡ ትቅትለኒኑ ፡ ትፈቅድ ፡ ኪያየኒ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በከመ ፡ ቀተልከ ፡ ትማልም ፡ ለግብፃዊ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወይስ ፡ ትናንት ፡ ያን ፡ ግብፃዊ ፡ እንደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገደልኸው ፡ እኔንም ፡ ልትገለኝ ፡ ትወዳ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለህን ፡ አለው ፡ ምነው ፡ ወነጸረ ፡ ሙሴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለፌ ፡ ወለፌ ፡ ብሎ ፡ የለም ፡ ቢሉ ፡ እሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላየም ፡ አለ ፡ እንጅ ፡ ሌላ ፡ አላየውም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ፡ በቅጠል፡ ቀዳዳ፡ ሁኖ፡ ሲመለከተው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የነበረ ፡ ነው ። አንድም ፡ ያዳነው ፡ ሰው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የነገረው ፡ ነው ፡ ዛሬ ፡ ወንድሜ ፡ ሙሴ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባይኖር ፡ ያ ፡ ግብጻዊ ፡ ሊገለኝ ፡ ነበረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ፡ አመስጋኝ ፡ አማሳኝ ፡ እንዲሉ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ ያዳነው ፡ ሰው ፡ ነው ፡ ድኃን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ካሳደገ ፡ ያነቀ ፡ ጸደቀ ፡ እንዲሉ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": "፳፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳፱ ፤ ወበእንተ ፡ ዝ ፡ ነገር ፡ ተኀጥአ ፡ ሙሴ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስለዚህም ፡ ነገር ፡ ሙሴ ፡ ኮበለለ ፡ ወከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
